{"articleNo":"73588","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=73588&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"가상화 서버 이전에 따른 관련서비스 일시 중지 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2013.01.09","hit":"4340","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><!--[if !mso]><style>v\\:* {behavior:url(#default#vml);}o\\:* {behavior:url(#default#vml);}w\\:* {behavior:url(#default#vml);}.shape {behavior:url(#default#vml);}</style><![endif]--></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"background:#ffffff;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;background:#ffffff;\">안녕하십니까</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;background:#ffffff;\" lang=\"EN-US\">? </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;background:#ffffff;\">정보전산원입니다</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;background:#ffffff;\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"background:#ffffff;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">  &nbsp;  </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"background:#ffffff;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;background:#ffffff;\">현재 운영 중인 서버들을 대상으로 가상화 시스템을 구축하여 자원의 효율성을 향상 및 </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;background:#ffffff;\" lang=\"EN-US\">Green IT</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;background:#ffffff;\">기반을 조성하기 위한 작업의 일환으로 현재 운영중인 서버들의 가상화 이전 작업을 실시하고자 합니다</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;background:#ffffff;\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;background:#ffffff;\">이와 관련하여 관련된 서비스들을 일시 중지하오니 업무에 참고하시기 바랍니다</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;background:#ffffff;\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"background:#ffffff;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">  &nbsp;  </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"background:#ffffff;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;background:#ffffff;\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><font color=\"#FF007F\"><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;background:#ffffff;\" lang=\"EN-US\">* </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;background:#ffffff;\">일시중지 일시 </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;background:#ffffff;\" lang=\"EN-US\">: 2013.01.11.(</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;background:#ffffff;\">금</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;background:#ffffff;\" lang=\"EN-US\">) 19:00 ~ 2013.01.13.(</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;background:#ffffff;\">일</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;background:#ffffff;\" lang=\"EN-US\">) 22:00</span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"background:#ffffff;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><font color=\"#FF007F\">  &nbsp;  </font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"background:#ffffff;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><font color=\"#FF007F\"><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;background:#ffffff;\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;background:#ffffff;\" lang=\"EN-US\">* </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;background:#ffffff;\">일시중지 서비스</span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"background:#ffffff;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><font color=\"#FF007F\"><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;background:#ffffff;\" lang=\"EN-US\">- </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;background:#ffffff;\">웹메일</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;background:#ffffff;\" lang=\"EN-US\">(mail.kumoh.ac.kr) </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;background:#ffffff;\">서비스</span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"background:#ffffff;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><font color=\"#FF007F\"><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;background:#ffffff;\" lang=\"EN-US\">- UMS(ums.kumoh.ac.kr) </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;background:#ffffff;\">서비스</span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"background:#ffffff;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><font color=\"#FF007F\"><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;background:#ffffff;\" lang=\"EN-US\">- VOD(</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;background:#ffffff;\">통합교육시스템 동영상 강의</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;background:#ffffff;\" lang=\"EN-US\">) </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;background:#ffffff;\">서비스</span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"background:#ffffff;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;\"><font color=\"#FF007F\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;background:#ffffff;\">- 키오스크버스예약시스템</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;background:#ffffff;\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;background:#ffffff;\">모바일통합버스예약시스템</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;background:#ffffff;\" lang=\"EN-US\">, u-campus </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;background:#ffffff;\">웹페이지</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;background:#ffffff;\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;background:#ffffff;\">관리자 페이지 포함</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;background:#ffffff;\" lang=\"EN-US\">) </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;background:#ffffff;\">등 </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;background:#ffffff;\" lang=\"EN-US\">u-campus </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;background:#ffffff;\">관련 모든 서비스</span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"background:#ffffff;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><font color=\"#FF007F\"><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;background:#ffffff;\" lang=\"EN-US\">- 무선인증서비스</span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"background:#ffffff;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;\"></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"background:#ffffff;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">  &nbsp;  </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"background:#ffffff;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;background:#ffffff;\">웹메일 서버 이전 기간중 수신 메일은 스팸필터 서버에서 임시 보관되며</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;background:#ffffff;\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;background:#ffffff;\">웹메일 서버의 이전이 완료되면 자동으로 일괄 수신됨을 알려드립니다</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;background:#ffffff;\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"background:#ffffff;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">  &nbsp;  </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"background:#ffffff;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;background:#ffffff;\">서비스 중단으로 인해 불편을 드려 죄송합니다</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;background:#ffffff;\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span>관련 <span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;background:#ffffff;\">업무나 학사일정관련하여 착오 없으시기 바랍니다</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;background:#ffffff;\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;background:#ffffff;\">협조감사합니다</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;background:#ffffff;\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
